From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: report the combination error when NAN evacuation fails

When ieee80211_check_combinations() refuses a channel,
_ieee80211_link_use_channel() tries to evacuate a NAN channel and then
returns the result of that attempt. Without a NAN interface the attempt
returns -ENOENT, so a refused interface combination reaches userspace as
"No such file or directory" instead of the error of the check.

Keep the error of the combination check when the evacuation does not
help.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---
--- a/net/mac80211/chan.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/chan.c
@@ -2305,12 +2305,12 @@ int _ieee80211_link_use_channel(struct i
 					   radar_detect_width, -1);
 	if (ret < 0) {
 		/* Let's check if evacuating a NAN channel will help */
-		ret = ieee80211_try_nan_chan_evacuation(local, sdata,
-							&chanreq->oper,
-							mode,
-							radar_detect_width);
-		if (ret < 0)
+		if (ieee80211_try_nan_chan_evacuation(local, sdata,
+						      &chanreq->oper,
+						      mode,
+						      radar_detect_width) < 0)
 			goto out;
+		ret = 0;
 	}
 
 	if (!local->in_reconfig)
